  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Evaluation ATU - Agadir Techn. Unit - Evaluation of ATU - Agadir Techn. Unit</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Utv&#xe4;rdering ATU Agadir Techn. Unit</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Agadiravtalet &#xe4;r ett frihandelsavtal mellan Egypten, Jordanien, Marocko och
Tunisien. Det undertecknades i Rabat i februari 2004 och tr&#xe4;dde i kraft i mars 2007.
Sedan 2012 (fas 1) implementerar den svenska myndigheten Swedac insatsen (fas 2 sedan 2014). Syftet &#xe4;r att st&#xf6;dja medlemsl&#xe4;ndernas p&#xe5;g&#xe5;ende arbete mot en harmonisering av tekniska handelshinder och standarder.

Denna insats syftar till att utv&#xe4;rdera den p&#xe5;g&#xe5;ende interventionen (ATU) sedan 2014.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Agadir Agreement is a free trade agreement between Egypt, Jordan, Morocco and
Tunisia. It was signed in Rabat in February 2004 and came into force in March 2007. 
Since 2012 (phase 1) the Swedish Agency Swedac is implementing the intervention (phase 2 since 2014). The aim is to support the member countries&apos; ongoing work towards harmonisation of technical regulations, voluntary standards and conformity assessment. 
This intervention aims at evaluating the ongoing intervention (ATU) since 2014.</narrative>
  </description>
